Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add license-free Octave Docker backend

Build an Octave 10.3 image from the cms-cambridge/IPEMToolbox fork and expose
it as DEFAULT_OCTAVE_IMAGE. The entrypoint matches the MATLAB MCR CLI so the
existing docker_runner works unchanged.
